    <string name="explain_natural_long">Natural convection: the ventilation fan stays off, so the stove is quieter and the heat rises on its own. It is a different system from the ducts.</string>
    <string name="explain_ducts">The ducts are separate fan outlets that send hot air to other rooms. If you only heat one room you can hide this panel.</string>
    <string name="explain_multifire_long">Multifire is the multi-fuel combustion setting (pellet/wood). Your stove sends no text labels for its values, only 0-3; with natural mode on and power 4 the minimum allowed becomes 1.</string>

